# Nested SSOT aligned with root .gitignore (skill-create-gitignore)
# Track product law, the product test plan, and filled product checklists.
# Skills, templates, terminologies, incidents, policies, and housekeeping stay local.
# Filled checklists are versioned because the operator ordered them with the tests.
*
!.gitignore
!requirements/
!requirements/**
!checklists/
!checklists/**
checklists/README.md
!reviews/
!reviews/**
